1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
For 600 years, Xi'an woke to a bell and slept to a drum.
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,600
晨钟暮鼓 — morning bell, evening drum.

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,400
The Bell Tower went up in 1384, dead center of the walled city.

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:11,200
A bell at dawn opened the gates; a drum at dusk closed them.

5
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:14,000
No clocks, no phones — a whole city ran on two towers.

6
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:16,400
★ Expert Tip: go at dusk, when both towers light up.

